# Packages for the DraftOS Desktop live ISO.
# = archiso live essentials + install tooling (what the engine calls at runtime)
#   + a full COSMIC desktop (so the live medium boots into the DraftOS look)
#   + fonts. No arkdep: the Desktop edition installs a normal Arch base.

## --- Live system essentials (from archiso releng) ---
base
linux
linux-firmware
amd-ucode
intel-ucode
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso
mkinitcpio-nfs-utils
archiso
syslinux
edk2-shell
memtest86+-efi
squashfs-tools
dhcpcd
iwd
networkmanager
wireless-regdb
sudo
polkit
bash-completion
nano
vim
less
git
rsync
wget
curl
zstd
usbutils
pciutils

## --- Install tooling (the draftos-install engine shells out to these) ---
arch-install-scripts
gptfdisk
parted
dosfstools
e2fsprogs
exfatprogs
f2fs-tools
btrfs-progs
cryptsetup
nvme-cli
efibootmgr
libpwquality

## --- COSMIC desktop (live medium boots into the DraftOS look) ---
cosmic-session
cosmic-greeter
greetd
xdg-desktop-portal-cosmic
cosmic-wallpapers
cosmic-store
cosmic-terminal
cosmic-text-editor
cosmic-files

## --- Graphics / firmware for a broad range of live hardware ---
mesa
vulkan-intel
vulkan-radeon
vulkan-icd-loader
xorg-xwayland
xkeyboard-config

## --- Fonts / theming so the live desktop and installer render well ---
noto-fonts
noto-fonts-emoji
ttf-dejavu
inter-font
ttf-jetbrains-mono
